---
/**
 * Where somebody lands after using the optional details block at the foot
 * of /thank-you/. Set in the Kit settings for form 9918609, "Supporter
 * Details", under "When a visitor subscribes".
 *
 * This page exists because the alternative is worse. Kit's redirect is a
 * fixed URL, so sending people back to /thank-you/ would drop them on the
 * page they just submitted from, with the same empty form at the foot of
 * it and nothing to say whether anything happened. A form that gives no
 * answer reads as a form that failed.
 *
 * noindex. It means nothing to anybody who did not arrive here from that
 * block.
 *
 * NO GIVE BAND and no signup band. This person has joined the list and has
 * just handed over a phone number. There is nothing further to ask them
 * for on this page.
 */
import Base from "../../../layouts/Base.astro";
import PageHero from "../../../components/PageHero.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Details Saved"
  description="Your details are on your record with the Friends of the Latimer House."
  noindex
>
  <PageHero
    crumbs={[{ label: "Thank You", href: "/thank-you/" }, { label: "Details" }]}
    headline="That is on your record."
    lead="Thank you. We will use it the way the page said and no other way."
    image="/img/house-hero"
    imageAlt="A two storey hand hewn log house with a stone chimney, standing in grass behind a split rail fence."
  />
  <section class="band band--parchment torn-top">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="saved">
        <p class="eyebrow">While you are here</p>
        <div class="stack measure saved__body">
          {/* Written before the same loose sentence was corrected on
              /thank-you/ and on the privacy page, and missed in that pass.
              Unsubscribing stops the mail. It does not erase the record,
              and the paragraph below is what covers erasing it. */}
          <p>
            Nothing else changes. You are on the list exactly as you were, and
            the mail is still infrequent. The unsubscribe link in any email we
            send stops it at once.
          </p>
          <p>
            If any of it was wrong, or you would rather we did not hold it,
            write to us and say so. We will do it and we will not ask you why.
          </p>
          <p class="saved__actions">
            <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/the-story/">
              Read the story
              <span class="btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
            </a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .saved { max-width: 42.5rem; }
  .saved__body { margin-block-start: 1rem; }
  .saved__body p { color: var(--text-secondary); }

  /* The button carries its own hover transition, so the reveal animation
     goes on this wrapper instead. See the rule in global.css. */
  .saved__actions { margin-block-start: 1.75rem; }
</style>
